==== The 7-Biomarker Panel

*Immune markers*:
    - IL-8 (elevated): Neutrophil chemoattractant, inflammation
    - TNF-$alpha$ (elevated): Pro-inflammatory cytokine
*Vascular markers*:
    - von Willebrand Factor (VWF, elevated): Endothelial activation/damage
    - Fibronectin (elevated): Extracellular matrix protein, vascular remodeling
    - Thrombospondin (elevated): Anti-angiogenic, endothelial stress. Beyond its endothelial role, TSP-1 is proposed to antagonise irisin signalling at the HSP90#sub[$alpha$]/αvβ5 axis, linking this vascular marker to impaired metabolic adaptation in PEM (see @spec:tsp1-vascular-metabolic-convergence, @spec:irisin-signaling-resistance, @Souma2026IrisinSignalingResistance)
*Metabolic markers*:
    - Lactate (elevated): Anaerobic metabolism, mitochondrial dysfunction
    - Pyruvate (ratio altered): Impaired oxidative phosphorylation

